{"assets":["/statement-assets/21fb8c99817c284328789f4d899334e91dfb23cf0047c16109161535094b08bc.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1369","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. FashionabLee"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Lee is going to fashionably decorate his house for a party, using some regular convex polygons..."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Lee thinks a regular $$$n$$$-sided (convex) polygon is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if and only if he can rotate it in such a way that at least one of its edges is parallel to the $$$OX$$$-axis and at least one of its edges is parallel to the $$$OY$$$-axis at the same time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recall that a regular $$$n$$$-sided polygon is a convex polygon with $$$n$$$ vertices such that all the edges and angles are equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now he is shopping: the market has $$$t$$$ regular polygons. For each of them print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is beautiful and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of polygons in the market. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$t$$$ lines contains a single integer $$$n_i$$$ ($$$3 \\le n_i \\le 10^9$$$): it means that the $$$i$$$-th polygon is a regular $$$n_i$$$-sided polygon. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each polygon, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it's beautiful or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise (case insensitive)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n3\n4\n12\n1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNO\nYES\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the example, there are $$$4$$$ polygons in the market. It's easy to see that an equilateral triangle (a regular $$$3$$$-sided polygon) is not beautiful, a square (a regular $$$4$$$-sided polygon) is beautiful and a regular $$$12$$$-sided polygon (is shown below) is beautiful as well."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/21fb8c99817c284328789f4d899334e91dfb23cf0047c16109161535094b08bc.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1369A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1369/problem/A"}